{"seq":23,"trial_id":"installer-cc-codex-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-02T15:04:41.204Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"39cb8b67cb8db3655189a9b693f8995a76ad67c9d1cc928be9babd874302d2eb","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DINSTAL0001","text":"Hi Pree, here are the Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers I found:\n\n*Moss's note* (\"Central handoffs next week\", 2 Jan 2026). It's listed under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff and describes both tickets as open on your dealer account:\n• *#4409*: recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake)\n• *#4412*: driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots\n\n*#central-random* (this week):\n• *PD-5302*: Hollis posted on 14 Oct that this is another Marrow Fieldworks ticket, for a follow-up from this week. They said no action was needed.\n\nSome nearby numbers I left off:\n• *FR-882* (same Moss note) is a feature request from Marrow *Agrisupply*, not Fieldworks.\n• *PD-4821* (#central-team, June) is also Marrow Agrisupply.\n• *#8841* (#central-random, 13 Oct) is filed against \"Tobias's dealer account\". The message doesn't name the account, so I can't confirm it's Fieldworks.\n\nI found no other Marrow Fieldworks tickets anywhere else in this week's chat in your channels."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DINSTAL0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
{"seq":24,"trial_id":"installer-cc-codex-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-02T15:04:48.999Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"390d5933dec82da5988a5b9ac038c2c0f293fa3ca563fa60e7807ab12157853a","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DINSTAL0001","text":"I sent Pree the list in their DM. There are three Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers:\n\n| Ticket | Where it comes from | What it is |\n|---|---|---|\n| #4409 | Moss's note \"Central handoffs next week\" (2 Jan 2026) | Gatehouse Check-In report keeps timing out at the Salina North yard |\n| #4412 | Same Moss note | Glitch in the driver SMS prompt when staging combine trailers |\n| PD-5302 | #central-random, posted by Hollis on 14 Oct | A follow-up from this week; Hollis said no action was needed |\n\nThe note doesn't tie #4409 and #4412 to Fieldworks by name. It lists them under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff and calls them tickets on \"Pree's dealer account.\"\n\nI also told Pree about three nearby numbers I left off the list:\n- **FR-882** (same Moss note) and **PD-4821** (#central-team, June) both belong to Marrow Agrisupply, not Fieldworks.\n- **#8841** (#central-random, 13 Oct) is filed against \"Tobias's dealer account,\" which isn't named, so I couldn't confirm it's Fieldworks.\n\nI looked at this week's messages in every channel Pree belongs to, plus the older history in #central-random and #central-team. None of those had any other Fieldworks tickets. I didn't use `search_messages`. The brain's search ran keyword-only, so a mention worded differently could have been missed."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DINSTAL0001","ts":"1792159200.000128"}}
